+ f'Exact lexer-preserving indentation/blank-line counterfactual across {len(comp)} already-pruned marker-free outputs. Removes {fmt(sum(c["indent"]for c in comp))} indentation bytes and {fmt(sum(c["blank"]for c in comp))} blank-line bytes.',
